<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-FRANCE LEAD SWEDEN 2-1 IN DOUBLES - DAVIS CUP LATEST.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRANCE LEAD SWEDEN 2-1 IN DOUBLES - DAVIS CUP LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest score from the doubles in the Davis Cup final between Sweden and France on Saturday:</p>
<p>Guy Forget/Guillaume Raoux (France) lead Jonas Bjorkman/Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 6-3 1-6 6-3.</p>
<p>Tie level 1-1 after Friday's singles matches.</p>
